  message: "Corrected in PR #19 (dev 11b50fd980). metrics.py by_supply_chain_tier edges-view comment lumped tiers (2/3) as external-dependency graph SINKS; post-ADR-0041 only tier 3 (third-party) is a sink — tier 2 is internal/project-side, a SOURCE that can carry out-edges. Positive evidence: the loop at metrics.py counts src-tier edges for ALL src tiers incl tier 2 (no tier-2 exclusion) so behavior was already correct; only the explanatory comment was stale. Comment now names only tier 3 as the sink."  # 74c9
